WEBVTT

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:21.460
<i>Congratulations, Gel-chan!</i>

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:24.830
<b>Elected</b>

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.320
<i>I mean, Prime Minister Sadra!</i>

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:27.390
<i>Our quasi-regular is now a prime minister!</i>

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:28.980
<i>Well, what a feat! How wonderful!</i>

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:32.110
Grandpa, they say he's an alien.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:38.010
<b>Let's take a look at how the city's doing after Prime Minister Sadra's election!</b>

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:40.190
<i>Well, why not?</i>

00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:42.910
<i>This is the result of our direct vote.</i>

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:46.560
<i>I can just relate to him somehow, you know?</i>

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:47.920
<i>Even though he's an alien.</i>

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:49.470
<i>How strange.</i>

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:51.010
Huh?

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:53.190
So Prime Minister Gelu-lu is born.

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:55.530
Go, Bird!

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:58.840
Man, I still can't do it!

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:03.020
Tsubasa-chan, weren't you able to transform during the VAPE thing earlier?

00:01:03.650 --> 00:01:08.190
That time, I saw Rui-senpai being hurt,

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:10.720
and I just got so mad.

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:13.840
All the blood just rushed to my head.

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:18.350
I'd transformed before I knew it...

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:21.390
Then how do you feel now?

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:22.600
Huh?

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:23.990
Right now?

00:01:23.990 --> 00:01:26.800
Well, I guess I feel normal.

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:29.990
Tsubasa-chan's not a Gatchaman yet.

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:31.320
You're still Tsubasa-chan!

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:33.080
Huh?

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:34.900
I'm me?

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:50.570
Isn't this diagram too bloated?

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:51.290
Huh?

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:53.500
Well, um...

00:01:57.590 --> 00:01:59.470
About the defense budget,

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:01.510
why does it have to be so high?

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:04.550
Well, if I remember correctly, it's because...

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:39.460
I'll eradicate conflict from Japan!

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:44.990
And I'd like to make a nation where 
people are united and full of smiles!

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:47.720
Are we going to solve 
everything with military force?!

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:53.170
Akiyama-san, why do we 
need to use military force?

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:54.310
Huh?

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:55.420
Oh, no.

00:03:55.420 --> 00:04:00.630
I don't think military force is good, so... well...

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:01.780
Right!

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:04.510
Military force is never an option!

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:09.740
That's why I'm making my slogan

00:04:09.740 --> 00:04:13.100
"Our Hearts as One! 
Let's Create Our World Together!"

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:16.050
I'm going to move as speedily 
as I can through political reform.

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:17.260
Alien!

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:18.900
Don't talk bullshit!

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:23.530
Yoshikawa-san, I am an alien, 
so you're right about that!

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:25.860
But I never talk bullshit!

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:26.760
Huh?

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:28.670
U-Um, I suppose.

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:30.960
So, to get right to the point...

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:33.110
Hey! Try to transform!

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:39.120
Kishida-san!

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:40.090
What do you think?

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:41.460
Huh?

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.880
Well... W-Well done.

00:04:44.070 --> 00:04:45.630
Thank you!

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:50.850
So, about this year's budget,

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:54.230
I'll remake it based on my new slogan!

00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:58.650
Y-Your face is red!

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:01.220
Thank you for your opinion, Kashima-san!

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:04.870
Yes, my skin's been red 
since the day I was born!

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:06.620
Is something wrong with that?

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:15.580
Okay, who's the next heckler?

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.080
Prime Minister Sadra!

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:21.440
How do you intend 
to resolve the CROWDS problem?

00:05:22.240 --> 00:05:25.520
I intend to reach a resolution 
everyone can agree on.

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:28.210
I'll let you all know as soon as 
preparations are made.

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:31.160
There are rumors that you 
are in a romantic relationship

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:33.760
with Misudachi Tsubasa-chan, a Gatchaman.

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:35.750
A romantic relationship?

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:38.640
So... Are you two in love?

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:40.950
I like Tsubasa-chan a lot.

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:42.850
She's a really great person!

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:50.870
So, given how you're manly and all,

00:05:51.270 --> 00:05:54.370
is your other manifesto also respectable?

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:58.540
Umm... What did you want to talk about?

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:00.820
Ah, right.

00:06:00.820 --> 00:06:02.430
Everything is so new to you—

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:04.880
perhaps you're having a difficult time.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:07.170
I have experience and connections.

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:09.550
I'll help you in any way I can.

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:12.100
Okay. Thank you.

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.360
They're all over the place?

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:21.100
Yes.

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:24.620
What the Diet members say is 
very different from what they think.

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:26.790
I feel very uncomfortable.

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:28.990
They're reading the mood.

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:31.540
Reading the mood?

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:36.980
Yeah, they sense stupid things like the fact that you're new to politics

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:39.240
or that you're popular and 
have a lot of push in the moment,

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:43.230
so then they badger you 
or try to get on your good side.

00:06:43.480 --> 00:06:44.250
I see.

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:46.580
Listen, Gel-kun.

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:49.840
Politicians aren't the ones 
making this country what it is.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:51.390
Everyone is.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:52.680
Everyone?

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:54.550
Everyone!

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:01.760
I want to know more about 
what everyone's thinking!

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:05.990
Gel-chan, I'll help, too!

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:07.420
Thank you.

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:27.210
Tsubasa-chan, the air's nice and fresh here.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:28.670
Yep.

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:31.220
I kinda reminds me of Nagaoka.

00:07:31.690 --> 00:07:33.160
Takamatsu.

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:34.490
Takamatsu.

00:07:38.210 --> 00:07:40.730
Good morning, everyone.

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:46.120
Hi, everyone!

00:07:46.120 --> 00:07:48.190
There's lot of space around me!

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:51.360
My face is red, and my hair is blue,

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:53.660
but I am a very decent alien!

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:56.240
I won't bite. Ever.

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:59.620
Let's work together to make 
this as painless as possible!

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:03.790
Prime Minister Sadra, 
you're commuting by train?

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:05.160
Yes!

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:07.500
Oh, you can call me Gel-chan.

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:14.100
Oh, if it isn't the Prime Minister!

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:16.470
What? Hey, alien!

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:19.600
What's big brass like you doin' here, eh?!

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:24.560
Oh, even I want to drink 
until I pass out sometimes.

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:27.060
Also, my face is red,

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:28.560
but I'm still sober.

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:29.850
He's funny!

00:08:29.850 --> 00:08:31.280
I like him.

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:34.470
Hey, Gelra!

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:36.530
There are too many politicians!

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:39.350
Hey, what's the salary for politicians?

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:42.060
They earn about twenty million on average.

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:45.190
Also, the Prime Minister 
earns about forty million.

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:46.290
Wow!

00:08:47.740 --> 00:08:49.580
You tax thief!

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:51.060
It's too high, right?

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:53.310
Please tell me what you think.

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:55.300
Oh, excuse me!

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:57.830
Please get this man 
another round of draft beer,

00:08:58.290 --> 00:09:01.830
and four ice creams on top of that.

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:03.520
Oh, it'd be our pleasure!

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:12.980
Okay, everyone smile!

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:19.510
I'm sad we're not all united.

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:23.620
Now we are.

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:24.850
You're right!

00:09:24.850 --> 00:09:26.070
We're united!

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:28.880
Okay, here we go, everyone!

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:30.290
Gelu-lu!

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:31.900
Gelu-lu!

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:48.060
You're not going home?

00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:51.630
Isn't your family worried about you?

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:54.010
I don't have anyone at home at night.

00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:55.990
I see.

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.540
Okay!

00:09:58.240 --> 00:09:59.660
Let's play together!

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:20.260
Oh, wow!

00:10:21.460 --> 00:10:22.430
Wow!

00:10:24.940 --> 00:10:26.410
That's right!

00:10:26.410 --> 00:10:31.280
We are really lacking childcare facilities 
like kindergarten and preschool.

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:33.520
In some areas, they don't 
even have the budget.

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:35.710
I see.

00:10:36.430 --> 00:10:40.400
Leader, let's protect 
the children's future together!

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:42.790
O-Okay!

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:44.230
You're doing good, Sadra.

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:45.700
I'm gloomy.

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:47.030
What do you think?

00:10:47.030 --> 00:10:49.670
This is the best view on this island.

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:55.200
Are you okay?!

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:58.050
He's been like this recently.

00:10:58.050 --> 00:10:59.050
Has he been to the hospital?

00:10:59.280 --> 00:11:01.590
There are no doctors on this island.

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:05.760
We only get one doctor who comes here 
once a month from the mainland.

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:07.140
Prime Minister Sadra!

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:09.270
You're making trips like this every day,

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:10.810
but for what purpose?

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:14.280
Hey, watch it!

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:17.250
Are you okay?

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:18.400
Hey!

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:20.050
Apologize to him!

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:21.450
Sorry.

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:22.880
It's all right.

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:25.700
It's good that you're 
really invested in your job.

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:27.950
I'm really sorry.

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:30.760
It's all good.

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:32.550
Oh!

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:36.790
Since we're all here, let's have a professional photographer take a group photo!

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:37.950
Huh?

00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:39.970
Sure.

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:42.840
Okay, everyone. Please get together!

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:47.170
Goodbye!

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:54.370
Tsubasa-chan, you're the kind of person who can make other people smile.

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:55.160
Huh?

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:57.230
Where's this coming from, Gel-chan?

00:11:57.540 --> 00:12:01.130
Tsubasa-chan, I'd like to have 
your support moving forward.

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:04.160
Let's make everyone's hearts into one.

00:12:05.270 --> 00:12:06.360
Okay!

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:16.130
Okay, everyone.

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:18.460
Breathe in deep! Deep!

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:21.200
Oh, Sugane-kun's here!

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:21.920
Huh?

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:23.180
What's that?

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:24.370
What?!

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:26.260
You don't know?!

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:28.830
It's called the Gel sign.

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:29.590
See?

00:12:29.590 --> 00:12:32.970
Oh, it's popular?

00:12:41.340 --> 00:12:42.240
I see.

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:45.300
So you're back because 
of work with Gel-chan.

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:46.370
That's tough.

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:49.910
You must be busy, 
but do take care of yourself.

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:51.530
Got it!

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:52.810
Okay!

00:12:53.950 --> 00:12:58.540
I just don't want to see 
anyone feel sad anymore.

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:02.710
That's why I want to protect 
peace for everyone with Gel-chan.

00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:04.600
What's peace?

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:05.300
What?

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:08.300
What's peace to you?

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:09.700
Well...

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:13.810
I guess it'd be everyone 
being united... and happy.

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:16.410
What does it mean to be united?

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:18.360
Are you and I united?

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:19.520
Of course.

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:23.000
You and I, our souls are connected.

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:24.520
No.

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:25.450
I'm me.

00:13:26.690 --> 00:13:27.850
Yuru-jii!

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:29.780
Don't say such sad things!

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:32.700
So if our souls are connected, 
we become united?

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.070
And there'd be peace?

00:13:35.070 --> 00:13:36.210
Yeah!

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:39.480
If everyone can understand each other at that level and become one,

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:41.670
there will be no more conflict!

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:44.500
What if there are people 
who don't think that way?

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:48.220
Then I'll just try harder until they do!

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:50.620
You know nothing.

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:51.680
That's not true!

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:55.770
We're fighting every day out there in a world you don't understand!

00:13:56.070 --> 00:13:57.900
Don't throw that word around like you know what it means to fight.

00:13:58.260 --> 00:14:00.490
What do you know?

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:04.110
You're just staring at 
the shogi board every day!

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:06.660
I'm done.

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:08.990
Tsubasa, come back to Nagaoka.

00:14:10.130 --> 00:14:11.400
What do you mean?

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:14.170
Yuru-jii, stop.

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:17.930
Tsubasa and Gel-chan 
are working hard every day.

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:20.320
Working hard is enough?

00:14:20.320 --> 00:14:22.600
That pardons everything else?

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:25.550
Stop it. You're just arguing 
for the sake of argument.

00:14:29.870 --> 00:14:32.280
Come home, Tsubasa.

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:33.190
No!

00:14:33.190 --> 00:14:35.310
Then I won't teach you fireworks.

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:38.310
I don't care anymore!

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:40.980
Tsubasa-chan.

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:56.280
I'm gonna do this!

00:14:56.280 --> 00:14:58.770
Just watch, Yuru-jii!

00:14:58.770 --> 00:14:59.840
Tsubasa-chan?

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:02.250
Well, that made me feel a lot better.

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:04.920
Gel-chan, let's protect peace!

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:06.320
Okay!

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:12.550
What a surprise!

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:15.850
The new cabinet — is just Gel-chan!

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:20.800
Umm... Then what about the cabinet members?

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:25.650
I had all the politicians and officials resign

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:30.450
<i>and work instead in jobs 
appropriate to their specializations.</i>

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:35.080
<i>Er, then what about the National Diet?</i>

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:39.870
<i>Right, that's being renovated so that the citizens can make good use of it.</i>

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:40.770
<i>News? Huh?</i>

00:15:40.770 --> 00:15:42.900
<i>Then where will the Diet sessions be held?</i>

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:45.590
<i>At Tachikawa City's Flower Green Park!</i>

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:47.840
So you'd have it by yourself, Prime Minister?

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:50.720
No, it'll be me and everyone else!

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:53.180
I'd like everyone to freely comment.

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:54.440
Wow!

00:15:54.090 --> 00:15:55.510
This is a revolution, right?

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:56.140
That's pretty good.

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:57.470
Extra! Extra!

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:57.470
<b>The Sadra Cabinet is Just One Member!!</b>

00:15:57.730 --> 00:16:00.290
Only one politician! Wow!

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:04.040
"Prime Minister Slashes Own Salary Down 
to Minimum Needed to Meet Living Costs."

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:06.320
Wow! What's this?!

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:07.280
Huh.

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:10.730
"Prime Minister to Disclose 
All Daily Expenditures on GALAX."

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:11.980
Holy cow!

00:16:11.980 --> 00:16:14.830
"Open Diet Session to Be 
Broadcast Live from Park."

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:17.120
Maybe I'll make a comment.

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:23.610
"All Political Decisions to Be Made via Citizen 
Smart Phone Vote in Remote Direct Participation."

00:16:23.610 --> 00:16:26.600
So that means we can all decide?

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:28.580
That's very open of him.

00:16:29.060 --> 00:16:33.500
This is a huge revolution 
that'll go down in Japan's history!

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:35.850
But it's almost too revolutionary.

00:16:35.850 --> 00:16:38.720
I hope he can handle 
doing everything by himself.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:42.560
But there was a lot 
of money going toward paying

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:45.130
Diet members and 
to manage Diet proceedings.

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:48.730
If this tax money can be 
effectively repurposed, it'll be huge!

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:50.410
And think about all the elections.

00:16:50.410 --> 00:16:53.900
I think each election 
costs 60 billion yen.

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:54.410
Hmm?

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:00.830
What?!

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:03.310
Here are the results of the smart phone vote:

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:06.600
<b>Click Here to Start Voting</b>

00:17:03.310 --> 00:17:08.160
Do you support the new 
cabinet system and policies?

